## Configuration

✅ **Security configuration is within recommended limits**

## Recommendations

1. Always use rate limiting for network operations
2. Set appropriate buffer size limits based on your use case
3. Validate all input data before unpacking
4. Use strict mode in production environments
5. Regularly audit code using SecurityAudit::auditBinaryStructure()
6. Implement proper error handling for security exceptions
7. Run raw socket operations with minimum required privileges
